              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Light therapy is gradual, not dramatic. This is a supportive addition to a scalp care routine — not a medical device, not a guaranteed fix. Results vary, and some people will see little or no change. If hair loss is genuinely worrying you, talk to a GP or dermatologist first.</p><p>Dispatch takes 1–2 business days, then 7–14 business days to Ireland and the UK and up to 20 further afield. Free standard delivery within Ireland. You get a 14-day legal right to cancel and a 30-day return window on top of it, and we cover return postage on anything faulty.</p>",
